%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-strings-functions-leftpad (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::core::Strings
output application/json
---
{
   "a": leftPad(null, 3),
   "b": leftPad("", 3),
   "c": leftPad("bat", 5),
   "d": leftPad("bat", 3),
   "e": leftPad("bat", -1)
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "a": null,
  "b": "   ",
  "c": "  bat",
  "d": "bat",
  "e": "bat"
}
